    "snippet": "- Isolated thunderstorms are expected across the AZ high terrain this afternoon and evening with less than 10% chances for the lower deserts. After the biggest monsoon event of the season so far in the Phoenix Metro area, we are not anticipating much if any activity in the lower deserts today due to an overturned atmosphere.",
